{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06297","headline":"奉和许给事夜直简诸公 · 崔颢","name":"奉和许给事夜直简诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西掖黄枢近，东曹紫禁连。\n地因才子拜，人用省郎迁。\n夜直千门静，河明万象悬。\n建章宵漏急，阊阖晓钟传。\n宠列貂蝉位，恩深侍从年。\n九重初起草，五夜即成篇。\n顾己无官次，循涯但自怜。\n远陪兰署作，空此仰神仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06297.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06297","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}